    "OverShoulderAction": {
      "description": "Over-the-shoulder camera: positioned behind `a`, looking at `b`.\n\nClassic dialogue framing \u2014 the viewer sees the side of A's shoulder/head\non one edge of the frame with B in conversation across the cut. The\ncamera sits at a fixed offset behind A (along the -direction from A to B)\nand looks at B's upper body.",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "start": {
          "minimum": 0,
